# Generated from packages/hw-legion/gpu.in by scripts/render.py. Edit the .in file, not this one.
# /etc/oaxaca/gpu, installed by oaxaca-hw-legion: the GPUs Hyprland renders on, one device
# per line, read at every login by oaxaca-session's user environment generator
# (50-oaxaca-gpu), which resolves a by-path name to the card's node and exports it to Hyprland
# as AQ_DRM_DEVICES. Lenovo Legion Pro 7 16IAX10H: every display of this laptop (the internal
# panel and both DisplayPort outputs) is wired to the Intel GPU, so rendering there copies no
# frames between GPUs and lets the NVIDIA GPU power down when no game or browser uses it. The
# by-path name is stable across boots where /dev/dri/cardN is not.
/dev/dri/by-path/pci-0000:00:02.0-card
